WEBVTT

00:03:56.956 --> 00:04:00.116
because if you put trees
in the wrong place ...

00:04:00.116 --> 00:04:01.116
they burn.

00:04:02.716 --> 00:04:05.916
We have to put trees in places
where they foster biodiversity,

00:04:05.916 --> 00:04:08.556
where they don’t compete
with food for land

00:04:08.556 --> 00:04:13.076
and where science and technology
tell us they are likely to survive

00:04:13.076 --> 00:04:14.756
even in the face of climate change.

00:04:16.676 --> 00:04:19.196
Now, if you don’t want
that CO2 from the burning trees

00:04:19.196 --> 00:04:20.196
to get into the sky,

00:04:20.196 --> 00:04:23.156
you can actually burn the wood
deliberately in a power station,

00:04:23.156 --> 00:04:24.196
capture the CO2

00:04:24.196 --> 00:04:26.396
and bury it in a process known as BECCS,

00:04:26.396 --> 00:04:28.396
which also gives you energy as a sideline.

00:04:29.436 --> 00:04:33.876
